# Hushbringer stops an emblem's ability too (CR 114.4, 603.2), and "dying" is the creature's: an ability that triggers
# "whenever an artifact is put into your graveyard from the battlefield" does not trigger for an artifact creature that
# dies (the rulings: "won't trigger if an artifact creature dies while Hushbringer is on the battlefield"). Daretti, Scrap
# Savant's game to his -10 emblem, with Bot2's Hushbringer out from turn 2: on turn 11 Bot1 Bolts its own Ornithopter,
# which stays in the graveyard, then sacrifices a Lotus Petal, a noncreature artifact, which the emblem returns at the
# beginning of the end step.

